# comma · publish — post content to external platforms via API.
#
# Reserved module. Code here will publish finished markdown (or other
# rendered output) to platforms such as LinkedIn, Drupal, Medium, GitHub
# (gists/wikis), Mastodon, and similar — each behind its own API and
# authentication scheme.
#
# Conceptually distinct from convert.nu, which handles offline file
# conversion (markdown → PDF/HTML/DOCX/EPUB on disk). Convert renders
# locally; publish posts to a network destination.
#
# No commands are exported yet. Implementations will be added per platform
# as they are needed.
